WEBVTT

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.830
The challenger doesn't hesitate!

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.880
He forces forward with left-right combinations!

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.890
The champion is on the defensive!

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.180
<i>His punches are heavy!</i>

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.900
<i>I can't keep blocking them!</i>

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:23.960
<i>This...</i>

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.800
<i>When I get hit in the stomach...</i>

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.500
<i>a shock runs through my body.</i>

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.830
<i>That's what stopped my legs.</i>

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.730
Another left to the body and the challenger keeps pushing forward!

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:34.870
Left! Right!

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.840
They're hammered down on top of his guard!

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.310
Solar Plexus Blow.

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:40.420
That'll do the trick.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.090
Solar Plexus?

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.900
A punch to the pit of the stomach.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:48.350
You guys are so worried about Gero-michi playing dirty that you've overlooked the punch he follows it up with.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:52.330
Now that you mention it, he never threw any punches there in the video that we saw.

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:53.790
So it's a secret weapon then?

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:55.100
It's not.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:59.270
I think he's just pulling off something he was advised to do.

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:02.670
To be able to do something like that on the spot means his lower body is in great shape.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:03.360
His lower body?

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:06.660
The two years we don't know about...

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:09.370
must have been spent running his ass off.

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:12.200
Gero-michi...

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:17.080
It means that Gero-michi has spent his time wisely as a boxer.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.150
A right!

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:23.380
A direct hit to the champion's head!

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:25.410
He's getting hit in the face now!

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:26.970
Is he having trouble?

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:28.330
What are you doing!?

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:30.590
You shouldn't have trouble putting away cannon fodder!

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:33.230
But, is he really cannon fodder?

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:35.910
I mean, he looks pretty strong!

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:38.310
He sure doesn't seem like an underdog.

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:40.640
His record is 8 wins in 8 matches!

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:42.110
He's got a good chance!

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.610
Come on, Hammer!

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:51.120
A chant of "Hammer" springs forth with the challenger's assault!

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:53.200
<i>Senpai can't fight back!</i>

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.870
<i>He's tightening his guard!</i>

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:57.120
<i>My punches must be affecting him!</i>

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:05.940
Man, the other side's really getting heated up.

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:06.830
Hey...

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:08.550
Over there, by the door...

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:11.150
Isn't that Gero-michi's...

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:12.010
Yeah.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.520
<i>Naomichi... {jama: added}</i>

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.300
<i>The whole time...</i>

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:19.880
<i>I kept running.</i>

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:21.690
<i>Even though you weren't there anymore,</i>

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:25.690
<i>I could still see you clearly in front of me!</i>

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:27.940
<i>I never lost sight of you!</i>

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:30.890
<i>I pushed myself as hard as I could.</i>

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:33.700
<i>I did everything that I possibly could!</i>

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:37.960
<i>How am I, senpai!?</i>

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:38.730
<i>Have I...</i>

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:42.960
<i>gotten any closer!?</i>

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:47.920
<i>You've gotten a lot stronger.</i>

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:51.290
<i>The person who looked up to me...</i>

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.560
<i>My first kouhai, Yamada-kun...</i>

00:02:55.390 --> 00:03:00.100
<i>He's standing before me as a real pro, as a boxer,</i>

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:01.870
<i>right now!</i>

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:03.360
<i>But...</i>

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:14.030
<i>Senpai...</i>

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:16.290
<i>Yamada-kun...</i>

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:19.840
<i>You still...</i>

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:25.050
<i>have a lot to learn.</i>

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:28.590
Whoa, the champion has opened his guard!

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:31.610
Is he provoking the challenger to attack him!?

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.930
<i>Senpai...</i>

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.690
<i>You're the one who is being cornered.  {Solo-  Yes this line is correct.  I verified it with TL}</i>

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:43.360
<i>If you won't come, then I will.</i>

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.660
<i>What pressure.</i>

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.190
<i>Senpai was always so nice.</i>

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.700
<i>He's someone who always manages a comeback KO.</i>

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.600
<i>There's no telling what he might try if I face him down,</i>

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:56.810
<i>but I can't back down now!</i>

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:57.840
<i>This is my chance!</i>

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:00.170
<i>Have faith in those two years!</i>

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.210
The challenger charges in!

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:05.710
Ippo-kun, put your guard up and try to get out of the corner!

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.990
This is no time to take him lightly!

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:09.460
He's not!

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:11.820
Ippo's desperate too.

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:14.020
It might've looked like that attack to the body was what kept him back,

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.510
but it was actually because he was intimidated.

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.020
To get the momentum going in his direction, he has to fight back with spirit as well!

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:22.520
He's decided the best way to do that is a straight-up slugfest with no tricks involved!

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:25.560
That's why he's risking it all to fight back!

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:28.650
If Ippo's being pushed to do all that...

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:31.240
...then Gero-michi has gotten that much stronger.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.130
<i>Everyone else I've fought has fallen after one of those!</i>

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.490
<i>How's that!?</i>

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.530
<i>I can't believe how strong that swing was!</i>

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:46.400
<i>It feels like the air pressure alone could knock me over!</i>

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:48.910
<i>But there's no way he isn't hurting!</i>

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:50.000
<i>This is my chance!</i>

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:55.760
He still moves forward, even after seeing that uppercut!?

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.260
Is he nuts!?

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:00.250
<i>There's no way he's not scared.</i>

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:03.300
<i>I'm sure he's fighting against crippling fear right now.</i>

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:04.890
<i>But even so, he'll move forward!</i>

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:08.230
<i>That's how determined he is about this match!</i>

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:12.690
<i>Regardless of the result, once this match is over, I won't have any regrets.</i>

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:15.200
<i>I'll retire.</i>

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.840
<i>Your determination for the last two years wasn't spent in vain!</i>

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:24.210
<i>If you put everything you've learned into this, then beating Makunouchi is a possibility!</i>

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:27.080
<i>How about that!?</i>

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:31.800
The champion fights back!

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:34.480
But the swing is wide and slices the air!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.970
<i>You can still fight back!?</i>

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:38.950
<i>How about now!?</i>

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:45.690
<i>Anyone else would have fallen by now.</i>

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:48.230
<i>How can he fight back!?</i>

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:54.950
<i>Isn't it working against him?</i>

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:57.950
<i>Aren't my punches affecting him!?</i>

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.590
Nao, it's working!

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:02.090
Don't hesitate, keep fighting!

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.180
<i>Be confident!</i>

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:07.960
<i>Put everything you've learned in the last two years into it!</i>

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.040
Oh, man!

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.650
He's really nailing him!

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:15.470
Get it together, Makunouchi!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:18.310
H-He's taking way too many punches!

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.380
He won't be able to-

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:20.880
He will!

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:25.470
The kid has survived stronger punches and tougher trials than this!

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:44.950
You can do it!

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:45.950
You can take it!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:57.130
Another hit to the solar plexus!

00:06:57.970 --> 00:06:59.970
No, this is bad!

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:02.630
Go, Nao! Finish him!

00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:23.740
He falls!

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:25.950
It's the champion's liver blow!

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:26.530
Get to a neutral corner!

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:29.130
After enduring an onslaught, he explodes.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.730
He changes the course of the match with a single punch!  {Solo-  there is such a distinct pause between lines I made this a new line}

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:34.750
This is Makunouchi Ippo!

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:36.540
<i>Yamada-kun...</i>

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:39.840
<i>There's still something you haven't learned.</i>

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.840
<i>It's a painful lesson,</i>

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:44.790
<i>but I was able to use it as a springboard.</i>

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:48.270
<i>I was able to win the belt because of it.</i>

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:50.930
<i>It's what Date-san taught me.</i>

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:52.130
<i>That's right.</i>

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.560
<i>You...</i>

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:58.050
<i>don't know what it's like to lose yet.</i>

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:05.160
<i>Body blows are supposed to take a while before they have an effect, but the pain that he's in...</i>

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:06.530
<i>It's not just disrupted breathing...</i>

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:09.230
<i>His ribs are probably broken too!</i>

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:14.390
<i>Despite all the punches we landed, he turned the tables on us with a single attack.</i>

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:17.420
<i>How can his punches be so unfair!?</i>

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:18.550
<i>That damn monster!</i>

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:24.980
<i>The pain is so much that,</i>

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:27.960
<i>instead of getting dizzy, it's making me think more clearly.</i>

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:31.560
<i>This is senpai's liver blow.</i>

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:33.250
<i>He really is amazing.</i>

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:36.530
<i>I'm really glad I made him my goal.</i>

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:41.410
<i>Every other boxer may look up to the world champion,</i>

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:45.130
<i>but I look up to him.</i>

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:49.580
<i>Makunouchi Ippo is my ultimate goal.</i>

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:53.590
<i>I'll stand.</i>

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:56.000
<i>As long as I'm conscious...</i>

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.950
<i>As long as I can move...</i>

00:08:57.950 --> 00:08:59.340
<i>I'll fight!</i>

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:00.910
FIVE

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:20.980
<i>The way he's hurt... his ribs are definitely busted.</i>

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:25.170
<i>If I don't stop the match, I'm sure you'll try to keep going.</i>

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:26.420
<i>The towel...</i>

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:28.710
He's gonna get up!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.630
You're kidding me! He shouldn't be able to get up after that!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:32.950
He's still getting up!?

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:34.900
Nao!?

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:39.460
<i>You haven't told Makunouchi everything yet, have you?</i>

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:40.730
He's getting up!

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:42.450
Amazing!

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:43.420
Nao...

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:44.470
<i>Mom,</i>

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:46.320
<i>you don't need to worry anymore.</i>

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:49.640
<i>Ever since I started boxing...</i>

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:51.720
<i>you've been worried about me, right?</i>

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:53.120
<i>But it'll all be over soon.</i>

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:55.180
<i>You're going to quit boxing?</i>

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:56.520
<i>Even though you love it so much?</i>

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:57.520
<i>I have...</i>

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:00.360
<i>a match with senpai coming up.</i>

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.590
<i>After that, I'll retire.</i>

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:05.840
Nao...

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.040
SIX

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:14.370
<i>I started boxing because I idolize him.</i>

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:17.670
<i>He has always been my goal,</i>

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:19.720
<i>and now I've reached him.</i>

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:20.810
SEVEN

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:22.750
<i>I don't think I can win,</i>

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.850
<i>but I won't leave with any regrets.</i>

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:26.660
EIGHT

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.390
<i>To me, this is...</i>

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:32.930
<i>my world title match!</i>

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:36.640
H-He's up!

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:39.120
Korakuen Hall is in shock!

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:43.140
Inspired by the challenger's spirit, an outpouring of cheers erupts!

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.810
Come on, Nao!

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:46.220
You're awesome!

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:47.910
You can do it!

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.200
<i>Nao...</i>

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:52.620
<i>You were always so proud.</i>

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:54.270
<i>Mom!</i>

00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:57.780
<i>Today I learned how to do a one-two!</i>

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:00.550
<i>I can't really do it right yet.</i>

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.710
<i>But Makunouchi-senpai's is awesome!</i>

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:05.280
<i>His hands are so fast that you can't even see them!</i>

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:08.330
<i>After meeting Makunouchi-san</i>

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:10.710
<i>you became so cheerful that it was like you became a different person.</i>

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:14.330
<i>I did worry, but it made me happy.</i>

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:20.130
<i>You might be proud of Makunouchi-san, but I'm proud of you!</i>

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:24.320
<i>I'm proud my son was able to fight evenly with such an amazing boxer.</i>

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:29.150
<i>So please do your best until the very end, Nao!</i>

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:36.790
Everyone's surprised that Gero-michi got up except Ippo.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:38.810
He looks like he expected it.

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:41.170
He's gonna calmly go in for the kill.

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:45.920
<i>When I received the request for this match, I wasn't sure what to do.</i>

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:52.620
<i>But this is a good chance for the kid to overcome his handicap of being too naive,</i>

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.930
<i>so that he can aim for greater heights!</i>

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:58.380
<i>I'll watch in your place, old man.</i>

00:11:58.380 --> 00:12:02.760
<i>Whether or not Ippo's got a good grasp on your baton.</i>

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:03.690
<i>We'll find out soon!</i>

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:05.820
Box!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:24.600
Whoa, the challenger makes the first move!

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:27.920
One-two!

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:35.390
He switches to the body with his specialty, the liver blow!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:38.390
But the champion calmly blocks!

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:40.140
Gero-michi...

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:41.640
The punch he learned from Ippo...

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:48.650
One-two!

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:50.650
It connects with his head!

00:12:50.650 --> 00:12:53.110
But he doesn't fall, he hangs on!

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:56.620
A direct hit to the liver!

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.620
His body is buckling over!

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:02.370
<i>Sen... pai...</i>

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:05.370
He shows incredible grit and doesn't fall!

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:07.960
A second one!

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:10.380
What a ruthless combo!

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:13.540
<i>Senpai...</i>

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.890
An uppercut!

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:21.400
He's not allowed to fall!

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:22.920
Nao!

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:28.220
<i>I've always looked up to you.</i>

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:30.900
<i>I idolize you.</i>

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.760
<i>Please don't lose.</i>

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.910
<i>Keep winning.</i>

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:46.660
<i>I'm proud to say...</i>

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:47.920
<i>that I...</i>

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:50.920
<i>fought against you.</i>

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:02.680
<i>Yamada-kun!</i>

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:18.310
The referee steps in as he falls!

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:21.200
And the bell for the match's end has been rung!

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:26.830
Emerging victorious is the senpai, Makunouchi, in this battle between former gymmates!

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:33.340
He succeeds in his second defense of the Japanese title!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.350
Nao? Nao, hang in there!

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:42.280
Are you okay?

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:43.350
Do you understand me?

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:48.850
Is the after taste from beating down your kouhai not sitting well?

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:52.660
It's just...

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.650
I really felt Yamada-kun's punches.

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:56.700
Honestly,

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:58.610
he made me worry more than a few times.

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:03.620
Right now, I'm more relieved that I was able to beat such a strong challenger.

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:09.620
Well, I suppose you've done your job as the champion.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:16.270
And now an interview from the champion after having successfully defended his title with an amazing KO!

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:19.070
How was it having to fight against a former gymmate?

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:20.230
Um...

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.640
Come on, Makunouchi!

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:26.860
When all is said and done, it was a second round KO.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.740
Details aside, it's just another win for him.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.700
Though Gero-michi did a great job too.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.210
Yeah. {jama: added}

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:36.360
How did you find the challenger?

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:38.990
It looked like you had a little trouble with him.

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:41.760
Oh, it wasn't a little at all!

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:43.780
He really had me there!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.790
I wouldn't want to fight him again.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:51.050
Would that be because it was hard fighting a former kouhai?

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.790
Um, not exactly.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.980
Putting all that aside, it's because he was really strong.

00:15:57.980 --> 00:16:00.810
Also because I was the same as him at one time.

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:04.420
I lost once and it was a painful time,

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:07.850
but it taught me a lot about boxing.

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:11.850
So I'm sure when he gets in the ring again...

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:14.610
he'll be...

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:18.010
a lot stronger than he was today.

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:24.330
You got hit way too much out there!

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:25.580
I could barely watch.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:29.530
If you keep slugging it out like that, you'll go nowhere fast!

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:31.080
I-I'm sorry.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:36.880
Are you even listening to me!?

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:39.000
I-I'm sorry!

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:44.090
You can't go see Yamada.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:46.840
B-But the match is over!

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:48.890
What would you say to him?

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:52.110
Console him with some sympathy?

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.510
Or maybe give a warm greeting?

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:58.860
Either way, as two people who just fought, it'd only be irritating.

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:01.900
In this world the winner...

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:04.820
has nothing to say to the loser.

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:11.410
I'm going to take a shower.

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:14.940
You ready to head home?

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:15.410
Right.

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:21.390
Once you get home, take two or three days to rest and then get a thorough checkup.

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.350
Right.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.420
And...

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.930
Makunouchi...

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:34.500
Did you tell Makunouchi everything you wanted to?

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:36.910
I don't know.

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:40.340
In the heat of the moment, I was so focused on punching...

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:42.440
But I managed to hit him.

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:46.410
And senpai fought back hard.

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:51.450
I fought with Makunouchi Ippo at full strength!

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:54.460
I'm satisfied!

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:07.430
When you say that with such a satisfied look on your face...

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:10.270
Well, if you're happy with it, then it's fine.

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:13.140
I'll just explain to everyone...

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.140
that Hammer Nao

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:19.650
has retired.

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:21.220
Coach...

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:25.160
Let's go, Nao.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.640
I have to...

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:29.100
I have to... apologize to my mother.

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:29.660
Nao?

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:33.160
I told her she wouldn't have to worry about me anymore.

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:37.310
But I heard senpai's interview.

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:40.670
He said I could become much stronger.

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:43.550
He fought me himself.

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:46.470
My senpai said it himself.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:51.530
That made me realize I could become even stronger.

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:53.890
And realizing that...

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:55.980
I think it'd be a waste.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:00.830
I can't quit boxing.

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:15.700
Makunouchi...

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:18.130
Senpai...

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.050
Nao, it's fine now.

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:26.060
Go greet your senpai after all this time.

00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:28.220
Senpai...

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:31.430
<i>Senpai.</i>

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:33.740
<i>Senpai!</i>

00:19:35.260 --> 00:19:36.690
Senpai!

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:39.930
You did it! I was so impressed!

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:40.920
Itagaki-kun!

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:43.400
That right you finished him with was the best!

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:45.440
You had a hard time though.

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:47.490
Are you sure?

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:48.440
Yes.

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:52.290
We already talked a lot,

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:54.950
and I learned a lot from him.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:56.880
<i>Yes...</i>

00:19:57.470 --> 00:19:59.960
<i>He taught me a lot in the ring.</i>

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:03.590
<i>And I'm going to keep chasing after him.</i>

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:05.960
<i>After senpai...</i>

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:09.330
<i>Thank you so much.</i>

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:18.930
<i>He really did get stronger.</i>

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:21.940
<i>That Solar Plexus Blow...</i>

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.440
<i>was an amazing punch.</i>

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:30.290
Ouch... {jama: added}

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.490
<i>It stings.</i>
